                "description": "Updates User for the following attributes:\n\n* **admin** (required).\n* **licensedSheetCreator** (required).\n* **firstName** (optional).\n* **groupAdmin** (optional).\n* **lastName** (optional).\n* **resourceViewer** (optional).\n",
                "type": "object",
